    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "USAIR.\nLOOK\nAT US\nNOW!\nUSAIR",
      "Fly to over 100 cities in the U.S.\nand Canada.\nUSAir offers business and vacation travelers a wide\nvariety of destinations. Every business day, USAir has\nover 1,000 flights to more than 100 cities.\nMONTREAL\nURLIVU TON\nUSAIR\nService to over 100 cities in the U.S. and Canada.\nDENVER H\nTORONTO\nNAGARN\nRANCISCO\nKANSAS CITY E\n• MINNEAPOLIS/ST. PAUL\nGREEN BAY\nGRAND RAPIDS I\nMILWAUKEE\nCHIAGO\nST. LOUIS I\nTON. D.C.\nWPOKI NEWS\nMOLIO URG NIA BEACH\nNASHVILL\nCOS ANGELE\n• SAN DIEGO\n• TUCSON\nDALLASIFT. WORTH\nAUST\nSAN ANTONIO\nTAMPAST. PETERSBUR\nFT.MYERS\n/EST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nSave Time!\nUSAir's schedules are designed to fit the business\ntravelers' needs with same-day, out-and-back service\nbetween many cities. An added convenience is the\nAllegheny Commuter system, providing frequent,\nwell-timed service linking smaller and mid-sized\ncommunities to major USAir cities.\nSave up to 70%!\nUSAir has many discount fares for both the\ngroup and vacation traveler. Restrictions apply.\nVacation Packages!\nFor leisure travelers, USAir flies to a host of vacation\ndestinations-Arizona, California, Canada, Colorado,\nFlorida, the South and many historic Eastern locations.\nFind out about our value-priced tour packages from\nyour travel consultant.\nMilitary Families Save 50%!\nUSAir offers a 50% discount for all U.S. active duty\npersonnel and their eligible family dependents-and\ndependents are not required to travel with the active\nduty member! Call your SATO or USAir.\nEarn Free Flights!\nJoin the USAir Frequent Traveler Program and\ndiscover how the miles you fly on USAir and\nAllegheny Commuter can add up to free flights.\nEnrolling is free and easy-simply fill out an appli-\ncation at any USAir or Allegheny Commuter ticket\ncounter. And you earn 1,000 bonus miles just for"
